<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Jasmine: Good looks for helpin’ at the\nLighthouse...\rBut this different. Um.\nLemme introduce myself.\rI’m Jasmine, a Block Boss.\nI use the...CLANG!\fSteel type!\r...You know Steel type?\rThey real hard, cold, sharp, and\nDEADASS strong!\fUm... I ain’t lyin’. Please believe me.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Jasmine: ...You a better Hustler than\nme. In skill AND kindness.\fI’m gon’ go cry quietly.\rBy League rules, here’s your Chain.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got\nthe Mineral Chain from Jasmine!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Jasmine: With that Chain,\nall homies, even traded\fones up to Lv. 70, listen\fto you, no questions.\fUm... Please take this too...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Jasmine: It’s called Steel Toe...\rYour homie kick ’em with\nsteel-toe boots, sometimes\flowerin’ their Defense...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Jasmine: Um...\rI don’t know how to say this, but...\ngood luck... Okay bye.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Jasmine: Long time, no see.\rUm... I’m good, good looks.\nI don’t know how to say this, but...\f...nothin’. I forgot.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Jasmine: Um... Er...\rWould you trade your homie\nfor mine? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Jasmine: For real? Good looks!\rI’ll be happy with any homie!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Jasmine: Oh, uh-huh, I see.\nThat’s disappointin’, but I get it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Jasmine: Good looks so much.\nI’ll take good care of it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Jasmine: You ever just wanna scrub a\nSteel-type homie? With a lil sponge?\fNo? Just me? Okay.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You gon’ trade {STRVAR_1 1, 1, 0}? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Jasmine: I like Eggs too, but\nI’d like a homie, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\fOne with a lil trainin’...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Jasmine: I’d appreciate it so much...\nBut I can’t accept such\fa precious homie.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Jasmine, the Block Boss? She at the\nLighthouse takin’ care of a sick homie.\rA STEEL Block Boss with a soft heart.\nThat’s like a tank with a teddy bear.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Jasmine use Steel homies.\rShe hidin’ how sweet she is behind all\nthat steel. Classic overcorrection.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That was HARD.\fSteel type, huh? That was a HEATED\fscrap! I’m sweatin’ and I just\nwatched!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I knew you’d come here.\rGood looks for helpin’ the Block Boss,\nbut a scrap is a scrap.\rGo for it! Bring fire! She hate fire!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">IMPRESSIVE!\rKeep travelin’!\rSince you got Hydrant Wave, try the\nLake of Rage. Somethin’ red out there.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Giggle...\rI know what you did at the Lighthouse.\nShe been blushin’ for DAYS.\rTime to show that side to Jasmine!\nGood luck, heartbreaker!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You AMAZIN’...\rAim higher with all that potential!\nYou been to Mahogany Town?\fThey got candy. Weird candy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Olivine City Block\nSteel-Toe Boots Required</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Olivine City Block\rBoss: Jasmine\nGot Ran Through By:\f{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}</language>
	</row>
</body>
